  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expenditure Verification: TCF II-PE NAOSU 2020-2022 - CTR 407234</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;In accordance with article &apos;4.15 Audit&apos; of the Programme Estimate and in line with provisions in the Annual Audit plan 2021, an expenditure verification of the 4 annual financial reports of the PE is required. A framework contractor from the &apos;AUDIT 2018&apos; is therefore to be requested to perform the verifications over a period of 3 years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The funds for the expenditure verifications (maximum budget &#xBF;55 015 EUR) are to be taken from the 02.03 budget line &apos;evaluation and audit&apos; on which there is a balance of 55 015 EUR.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
